PR #2663's generated body said “Testing Not run by the automation pipeline,” while live unit-tests and required-checks-gate passed on final head a1a3f26b0de9343a187fe5c336af16d0883bc3fa. GitHub exposed no review or issue-comment object. The correct audit used the durable GO label at 07:29:56Z, required-check completion at 07:33:48Z, and merge commit e8a6f40f72713c45a33a30098bc97d31708fc33d at 07:34:52Z; native auto-merge was null. This reinforces that live checks establish merge readiness only, never source-review authorization.

